l-specific deadlines, research-fit evidence, funding components and an original arrival-cash worksheet.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day15/study-desk-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-19\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/ntu-research-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is RSS for any NTU taught master’s?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Its central scope concerns graduate research. Check the exact school and degree for funding availability rather than transferring RSS terms to a coursework course.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does no bond mean no duties?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The central page also requires international scholars to fulfil Graduate Assistantship Programme duties. Read the actual award conditions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use 31 January for every school?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The central guide lists school-specific exceptions, and the NBS date here belongs to its namedAugust 2027 route.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L1c",false,"$L1d","$L1e"]}]
