1f:["$","p","Choose one degree record and save its school, intake, research area and application route. Then check the school’s own instructions for evidence and available support. If you are comparing a coursework master’s with a PhD, keep separate records: the programme structures, selection criteria and funding arrangements should not be merged into a single “NTU scholarship” application.",{"children":"Choose one degree record and save its school, intake, research area and application route. Then check the school’s own instructions for evidence and available support. If you are comparing a coursework master’s with a PhD, keep separate records: the programme structures, selection criteria and funding arrangements should not be merged into a single “NTU scholarship” application."}]
